Chapter: LinearCaptureOnce
  cites Foreword chapter Linear

 Regression guard for LinearOwnership stage 4: a let-bound closure
 that captures a linear value owns it and is call-once - calling it
 exactly once satisfies the discipline. A partial application
 through a linear-declared parameter is the same closure ownership,
 consumed by exactly one full application.

Section: Definitions

  use-closure : linear Integer -> Integer
  use-closure (n) = let f = (\x -> n + x)
   in f 1

  take2 : linear Integer, Integer -> Integer
  take2 (n) (x) = freeze n + x

  use-partial : linear Integer -> Integer
  use-partial (n) = let g = take2 n
   in g 5

  opening : Text = show (use-closure 41) & " " & show (use-partial 37)

